[[7,1,32768,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Disconnect the battery negative terminal.</p><p><a href=\"#/2753217\">7040L20</a></p><p>1. Disconnect the electrical connection for the yaw sensor.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>Slewing sensor (VDC)</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><strong>K74</strong></p></td></tr></table></div><p>2. Undo the fixing bolts (2a) and remove the sensor (2b).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2064786.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[7,1,32768,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Fit the yaw sensor in its seat and secure\nusing bolts.</p><p>Connect the electrical connection for the\nyaw sensor.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Slewing sensor (VDC)</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><strong>K74</strong></p></td></tr></table></div><p><a href=\"#/2753217\">7040L20</a></p><p>Connect the battery negative terminal.</p>"]]